# U-Boot Environment Configuration
# Generic configuration for eMMC/SD boot devices
# Format: Device name  Device offset  Env. size  Flash sector size  Number of sectors
#
# This file is auto-detected at runtime by the setup script
# Common locations for U-Boot environment on different SoCs:
#
# Rockchip (RK3588, RK3568, etc.): Usually in a dedicated partition or raw offset
# NXP i.MX: Typically at offset 0x400000 in boot partition
# TI AM335x/AM62x: Usually at offset 0x260000
# Allwinner: Typically at offset 0x88000
#
# Default: Use mmcblk0 with offset suitable for most ARM SoCs
# The setup script will detect and configure the correct values

# Placeholder - will be configured by setup script
# /dev/mmcblk0  0x3F8000  0x8000
